<newsitem itemid="777261" id="root" date="1997-08-04" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Country Casuals says takeover talks end.</title>
<headline>Country Casuals says takeover talks end.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British fashion retailer Country Casuals Holdings Plc said on Monday that talks about a potential takeover offer had ended.</p>
<p>Country Casuals has been in talks about possible offers in the last few months. In June, it said it had ended talks with Mark Bunce.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
